            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ರಾಜ ಸಿಂಹಾಸನದ ಮೇಲೆ ಕುಳಿತಿದ್ದನು. rāja siṃhāsanada mēle kuḷitiddanu. The king was sitting on the throne."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The lion seat, as ಸಿಂಹ is a lion. ಸಿಂಹಾಸನ (siṃhāsana) ಏರು, to climb the throne, is to become king."
            }
          ]
        },
