          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಿಂಹಾಸನ (siṃhāsana) is borrowed from Sanskrit siṃhāsana, \"the lion's seat, the king's seat, a throne\" (Monier-Williams), from siṃha \"a lion\" and āsana \"a seat\"."
